{"target":"git:sha1:5d2622748872b7e2dec3fe5c59e4be73a35e0bc8#git:sha1:5035ec1fbf24dc711a3c5f8df21999b3598276c7","text":"Withdrawn and replaced to carry its artifact in the body rather than only in the prose. The head, the branch and the conditions are unchanged and correct, and the artifact f3e06106 is live and not stale at that exact head — nothing about the work is wrong. What is wrong is the filing: the body carried branch, conditions, head and to, and no artifact, so the reference existed only as text. Nobody promised this request, so no reviewer's work is discarded.\n\nThis matters beyond tidiness. The readiness gate in AGENTS.md selects requests by body.artifact being non-empty, so a review request filed this way is invisible to it, and a gate that cannot see outstanding work can declare the workroom quiet while it is not. Records are immutable, so adding the field means replacing the request."}